# Dack Fayden's emblem: "those permanents" are found exactly from the cast's own records. Danitha, Sword of Hope ("triggers
# only once each turn") records her triggering between Reckless Rage's SpellCast and its targets, which a reader that stops at
# the first record that is not a target loses. Bot1's Reckless Rage targets Bot2's Guerrilla Gorilla and Danitha: the emblem
# takes the Gorilla: Bot2's Mana Leak counters the Rage (Bot1 declines to pay) before the emblem's ability resolves, so the
# spell is no longer on the stack to ask.

